Next rep
Report "M8b", best, 5000

' M9a: fit to 0-239 in a loop (find min/max, then scale)
best = 1E9
For rep = 1 To 3
  t0 = Timer
  For k = 1 To 5
    lo = a(0) : hi = a(0)
    For j = 1 To 999
      If a(j) < lo Then lo = a(j)
      If a(j) > hi Then hi = a(j)
    Next
    sc = 239 / (hi - lo)
    For j = 0 To 999
      b(j) = (a(j) - lo) * sc
    Next
  Next
  dt = Timer - t0
  If dt < best Then best = dt
Next rep
Report "M9a", best, 5000

